DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261010T203000
SUMMARY:The Haunted Farm
DESCRIPTION:Asheville 20s-40s Social Group\nThe Haunted Farm is Western No
 rth Carolina’s Scariest Attraction\, and has been Voted Best Haunted Hou
 se in NC!\n\nLocated in rural farmland near Hendersonville\, The Haunted F
 arm sits on a mysterious\, blood-soaked stretch of land where the locals c
 laim an age-old Blood Feud between the Lively and Tate families has devast
 ated the local farming community. The dark Haunted History of Curses\, Der
 angements\, Undead\, Ghosts\, and terrible Bloodshed brings visitors from 
 near and far – hoping to survive The Haunted Farm.\n\nIt is advised you 
 buy a ticket in advance incase they sell out but it is not mandatory accor
 ding to the website! It is not recommended if you have any serious heart o
 r anxiety conditions\, or are pregnant. They have a “chicken run” for 
 those who need a safe word and underwear for sale if you pee your pants.\n
 \nGet your tickets at:\nhttps://nchauntedfarm.fearticket.com/
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-20s-40s-social-group/events
 /316615555/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260918T194535Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260918T194535Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
